- Fixed an issue where hiding in-page sidebar functions may leave some blank placeholders when Resize Feed/Post is on;
- Fixed an issue where setting 100% width on inner grid containers may cause some profile pages to glitch or not display;
- Fixed an issue where "Expand feed/post to 100% below certain window width" may not work;
- Fixed an issue where having Just Open The Image turned off may cause the page to reload randomly, when opening the extension popup, fetching data from the Reddit APIs, or opening the post expandos on Chrome;
- Fixed an issue where "Hide post and sidebar dividers" may not work on comment pages (typo...);
- Fixed an issue where new comment sort URL may have an extra slash and prevent the observer from being attached;
- Fixed an issue where post gallery images may incorrectly align to the bottom left;
- Fixed a small issue where the dropdown menu for selecting the feed sort, post size and custom feed options might be covered behind the feed/sidebar below;
- Fixed an issue where subreddit icons in Compact view feed may have weird shapes when "Show vote buttons on the left" is on;
- "Full Width Subreddit Banner" should now no longer rely on Resize Feed/Post options to work;
- "Display page and user info in header" now displays the link karma, comment karma and account suspension status. It should also cache info from Reddit API and load much faster;
- Hide Blank Thumbnails in Compact View now hides link posts with no thumbnails and those of poll posts;
- Applied custom corner radius to more elements across the interface, including the subreddit/user hovercard;
- Small style tweaks for in-page sidebar on search result pages.
